-- title:
--   Cost of the recursion through the complex network
-- statement:
--   **Cost of the recursion through the complex network.** With `σ_c = log_m (s_c / W_c) < 1` (`m = 100³`), for every `λ > σ_c` (`λ ≥ 0`) and leaf width `u ≥ 1`, the recursive program whose local work is the restricted steps' actual work (`nloc · W_c · V`) costs `≤ V (K₁ (u m^k)^λ + C₀ (u m^k)^{σ_c} u^{1-σ_c})`.
